nsion. She can do all household chores.\n\nI would like you to draw my child with long hair. As for the composition, I would like you to draw her with her hair long and long, with her eyes hidden by her bangs, or with her hair tied back in a way that you think suits her.\nAs for the clothing, I would be happy if you could draw a different outfit such as a one-piece dress instead of the one in the reference.\nYou can change the above information if you think it suits you better.\nI know you are busy, but I would appreciate your consideration.", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 931064, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "\u7d05\u3044\u3042\u3081\ud83c\udf6d", "screen_name": "ame612_k", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1629059518368985088/T3nRh2ci.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/3246078698/1708340322/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "correction"}], "nc": 32}, {"id": 1201054, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "\u307d\u3068\u308f\u308a", "screen_name": "popotowari", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1498235865298259970/cbbi8CTc.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1392141413047930880/1640850409/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": 89, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 5, "complete_expiration_days": 10, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "nc": 177}, {"id": 1874112, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "MAMI", "screen_name": 